-0.0476005,0.02758861,0.06788265,-0.02506542,0.01113441,-0.02864343,0.02883674,0.05824668,-0.05704639,-0.03045944,-0.03051525,0.00114911,-0.01936541,0.01812886,0.00287638,0.01347863,-0.01000801,-0.00507424,0.11099771,0.0326185,0.0013072,0.0171524,0.00433821,0.01606415,-0.12339061,0.02647146,-0.00867904,0.04567948,-0.03304055,-0.01836063,0.04407767,-0.0040652,0.01077183,0.03337692,0.04448044,0.08858538,-0.01839582,0.06259515,0.05451966,-0.04651062,-0.0288519,-0.22509483,0.03657196,0.01285126,0.00826261,0.05911895,-0.0892285,0.04684619,-0.03038616,0.05883861,0.06031173,0.05363874,-0.00473471,-0.02661005,0.01305308,-0.02010969,0.02017502,-0.00402165,-0.00773294,-0.06207845,0.00523346,-0.01842897,0.03990657,-0.01072957,-0.04588314,0.02787749,0.01575195,0.15655757,-0.03881564,0.04061573,-0.01097762,0.0069809,0.01043996,-0.04454906,-0.0411136,0.05452619,0.02884354,0.03889291,0.01514534,0.0386811,-0.02076771,-0.02236027,0.02779387,0.02968687,-0.08800852,-0.06155994,0.01393556,0.01630404,0.03460037,-0.05602228,-0.01828864,0.03858892,0.01324865,0.00330704,0.00344008,0.0911307,-0.03289734,-0.0752888,0.06151926,-0.04762654,0.01568525,-0.01955619,-0.04376847,-0.00423583,-0.01015596,0.09711751,-0.0431572,-0.01345719,-0.03078111,-0.01035186,-0.0383923,0.04691929,0.14668529,-0.00997761,-0.04615497,0.10107948,0.02989185,0.03667082,-0.04389718,-0.02558961,-0.04019339,0.06262718,-0.04825484,0.0269233,-0.00449971,0.03619203,0.01335717,0.07353587,-0.06010778,-0.03066043,0.01486964,0.02632572,-0.02628318,-0.06686653,-0.02218581,-0.0008317,0.03657313,-0.27247056,-0.03801828,0.0226955,-0.00131814,0.01739226,-0.00644776,0.02438735,-0.0237269,-0.01338466,0.01354043,-0.06736597,0.02856369,0.02566089,0.00889571,0.03225839,-0.01878471,0.05137239,-0.04141436,0.13770466,-0.05418115,-0.02104375,-0.00691085,0.1412946,-0.06007533,-0.04640923,0.02708364,-0.03184152,0.01671358,0.07125028,-0.01406135,-0.00775051,-0.01047716,0.08148225,-0.04293663,0.00066957,0.10091539,-0.02702779,0.03899059,0.03234717,0.00123909,0.0696478,-0.006301,0.01271273,-0.06099086,0.10223597,-0.04806855,-0.01691527,-0.03601226,-0.00537002,0.03488608,-0.0484255,-0.00222725,0.00408347,0.02563813,0.05330163,0.01229857,-0.07623389,0.01464674,-0.05224349,-0.05842847,0.02630969,0.01373451,0.02683622,0.08192255,-0.04509771],"last_embed":{"hash":"1ldt2iw","tokens":460}}},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1ldt2iw","at":1774580835589},"key":"docs/SCALABILITY_ANALYSIS.md#Análise de Escalabilidade - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📊 Taxa de Processamento por Tamanho de Escola\\n\\n### Fórmulas de Cálculo\\n\\n```\\nTaxa de Processamento = (Número de Câmeras × FPS × Resolução) + \\n                       (Número de Alunos × Taxa de Análise) +\\n                       (Número de Alertas × Taxa de Processamento)\\n\\nCarga de CPU = Detecção + Reconhecimento Facial + Rastreamento + Análise\\nCarga de RAM = Buffer de Frames + Cache de Embeddings + Banco de Dados\\nCarga de Disco = Logs + Backups + Armazenamento de Imagens\\n```\\n\\n### Cenário 1: Escola Pequena (50 alunos)\\n\\n**Configuração Típica:**\\n- 2-3 câmeras (entrada, corredor, sala de aula)\\n- 1-2 períodos simultâneos\\n- 50 alunos\\n\\n**Taxa de Processamento:**\\n```\\nFrames por segundo: 2 câmeras × 30 FPS = 60 FPS\\nDetecção: 60 FPS × 0.8ms = 48ms por frame\\nReconhecimento: 50 alunos × 0.5s por aluno = 25s (batch)\\nRastreamento: 60 FPS × 0.2ms = 12ms por frame\\nAnálise de Presença: 50 alunos × 10ms = 500ms\\n\\nTempo Total de Processamento por Ciclo: ~100ms\\nLatência Máxima: 500ms\\nThroughput: 10 ciclos/segundo\\n```\\n\\n**Requisitos de Hardware:**\\n\\n| Componente | Mínimo | Recomendado | Premium |\\n|-----------|--------|-------------|----------|\\n| CPU | Intel i5-8400 | Intel i7-10700K | Intel i9-12900K |\\n| Cores | 6 | 8 | 12+ |\\n| RAM | 8 GB | 16 GB | 32 GB |\\n| GPU | Integrada | GTX 1650 | RTX 3060 |\\n| SSD | 256 GB | 512 GB | 1 TB |\\n| Rede | 100 Mbps | 1 Gbps | 10 Gbps |\\n| Custo | $800 | $1,500 | $3,000 |\\n\\n**Uso de Recursos:**\\n- CPU: 25-35%\\n- RAM: 4-6 GB\\n- Disco: 10-20 GB/mês\\n- Rede: 50-100 Mbps\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Cenário 2: Escola Média (250 alunos)\\n\\n**Configuração Típica:**\\n- 8-10 câmeras (múltiplas entradas, corredores, salas)\\n- 3-4 períodos simultâneos\\n- 250 alunos\\n\\n**Taxa de Processamento:**\\n```\\nFrames por segundo: 10 câmeras × 30 FPS = 300 FPS\\nDetecção: 300 FPS × 0.8ms = 240ms por frame\\nReconhecimento: 250 alunos × 0.5s = 125s (batch)\\nRastreamento: 300 FPS × 0.2ms = 60ms por frame\\nAnálise de Presença: 250 alunos × 10ms = 2.5s\\n\\nTempo Total de Processamento por Ciclo: ~430ms\\nLatência Máxima: 2.5s\\nThroughput: 2-3 ciclos/segundo\\n```\\n\\n**Requisitos de Hardware:**\\n\\n| Componente | Mínimo | Recomendado | Premium |\\n|-----------|--------|-------------|----------|\\n| CPU | Intel i7-10700K | Intel i9-11900K | Intel Xeon W-2195 |\\n| Cores | 8 | 12 | 18+ |\\n| RAM | 16 GB | 32 GB | 64 GB |\\n| GPU | GTX 1650 | RTX 3070 | RTX A6000 |\\n| SSD | 512 GB | 1 TB | 2 TB |\\n| Rede | 1 Gbps | 10 Gbps | 25 Gbps |\\n| Custo | $2,500 | $5,000 | $10,000 |\\n\\n**Uso de Recursos:**\\n- CPU: 50-70%\\n- RAM: 12-18 GB\\n- Disco: 50-100 GB/mês\\n- Rede: 200-400 Mbps\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Cenário 3: Escola Grande (500 alunos)\\n\\n**Configuração Típica:**\\n- 15-20 câmeras (múltiplos prédios)\\n- 4-5 períodos simultâneos\\n- 500 alunos\\n\\n**Taxa de Processamento:**\\n```\\nFrames por segundo: 20 câmeras × 30 FPS = 600 FPS\\nDetecção: 600 FPS × 0.8ms = 480ms por frame\\nReconhecimento: 500 alunos × 0.5s = 250s (batch)\\nRastreamento: 600 FPS × 0.2ms = 120ms por frame\\nAnálise de Presença: 500 alunos × 10ms = 5s\\n\\nTempo Total de Processamento por Ciclo: ~855ms\\nLatência Máxima: 5s\\nThroughput: 1-2 ciclos/segundo\\n```\\n\\n**Requisitos de Hardware (Servidor):**\\n\\n| Componente | Mínimo | Recomendado | Premium |\\n|-----------|--------|-------------|----------|\\n| CPU | 2x Intel Xeon Gold 5220 | 2x Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 | 4x Intel Xeon Platinum 8490H |\\n| Cores | 36 | 56 | 96+ |\\n| RAM | 64 GB | 128 GB | 256 GB |\\n| GPU | 2x RTX 3070 | 4x RTX A6000 | 8x RTX A6000 |\\n| SSD | 2 TB | 4 TB | 8 TB |\\n| Rede | 10 Gbps | 25 Gbps | 100 Gbps |\\n| Custo | $15,000 | $30,000 | $60,000 |\\n\\n**Uso de Recursos:**\\n- CPU: 60-80%\\n- RAM: 40-60 GB\\n- Disco: 150-250 GB/mês\\n- Rede: 500-1000 Mbps\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Cenário 4: Escola Muito Grande (1000+ alunos)\\n\\n**Configuração Típica:**\\n- 30-50 câmeras (múltiplos campi)\\n- 5-6 períodos simultâneos\\n- 1000+ alunos\\n- Múltiplos prédios/unidades\\n\\n**Taxa de Processamento:**\\n```\\nFrames por segundo: 50 câmeras × 30 FPS = 1500 FPS\\nDetecção: 1500 FPS × 0.8ms = 1200ms por frame\\nReconhecimento: 1000 alunos × 0.5s = 500s (batch)\\nRastreamento: 1500 FPS × 0.2ms = 300ms por frame\\nAnálise de Presença: 1000 alunos × 10ms = 10s\\n\\nTempo Total de Processamento por Ciclo: ~2010ms\\nLatência Máxima: 10s\\nThroughput: 0.5 ciclos/segundo\\n```\\n\\n**Requisitos de Hardware (Cluster):**\\n\\n| Componente | Configuração |\\n|-----------|-------------|\\n| Nós de Processamento | 4-6 servidores (distribuição de carga) |\\n| CPU por Nó | 2x Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 (56 cores) |\\n| RAM por Nó | 256 GB |\\n| GPU por Nó | 4x RTX A6000 |\\n| SSD por Nó | 4 TB |\\n| Rede | 100 Gbps (inter-nós) |\\n| Load Balancer | Nginx/HAProxy |\\n| Banco de Dados | MySQL Cluster ou PostgreSQL |\\n| Cache | Redis Cluster |\\n| Custo Total | $150,000 - $300,000 |\\n\\n**Uso de Recursos (por nó):**\\n- CPU: 70-90%\\n- RAM: 150-200 GB\\n- Disco: 300-500 GB/mês\\n- Rede: 1-2 Gbps por nó\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🏗️ Arquitetura de Escalabilidade\\n\\n### Arquitetura 1: Single-Server (50-250 alunos)\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│         Servidor Único                  │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│  Electron App (UI + IPC)                │\\n│  ├─ VideoCapture                        │\\n│  ├─ FrameProcessor (YOLO)               │\\n│  ├─ FaceRecognition                     │\\n│  ├─ PresenceTracker                     │\\n│  ├─ AlertManager                        │\\n│  └─ WebSocketServer                     │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│  Node.js Backend                        │\\n│  ├─ Express API                         │\\n│  ├─ tRPC Procedures                     │\\n│  └─ Scheduled Jobs                      │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│  SQLite Database                        │\\n│  Logs & Backups                         │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n\\nVantagens:\\n- Simples de implantar\\n- Baixo custo\\n- Fácil manutenção\\n\\nDesvantagens:\\n- Ponto único de falha\\n- Escalabilidade limitada\\n```\\n\\n### Arquitetura 2: Multi-Tier (250-500 alunos)\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│           Load Balancer (Nginx)                     │\\n└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                 │\\n        ┌────────┼────────┐\\n        │        │        │\\n        ▼        ▼        ▼\\n   ┌────────┐┌────────┐┌────────┐\\n   │Server 1││Server 2││Server 3│\\n   │(Video) ││(Face)  ││(Alert) │\\n   └────────┘└────────┘└────────┘\\n        │        │        │\\n        └────────┼────────┘\\n                 │\\n        ┌────────▼────────┐\\n        │  MySQL Database │\\n        │  Redis Cache    │\\n        │  Shared Storage │\\n        └─────────────────┘\\n\\nVantagens:\\n- Escalabilidade horizontal\\n- Distribuição de carga\\n- Redundância\\n\\nDesvantagens:\\n- Complexidade aumentada\\n- Custo mais alto\\n- Sincronização de dados\\n```\\n\\n### Arquitetura 3: Microserviços (500-1000+ alunos)\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    API Gateway                              │\\n└────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                         │\\n        ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐\\n        │                │                │\\n        ▼                ▼                ▼\\n   ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐\\n   │ Video    │    │ Face     │    │ Alert    │\\n   │Service   │    │Service   │    │Service   │\\n   │(3 nodes) │    │(4 nodes) │    │(2 nodes) │\\n   └──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘\\n        │                │                │\\n        └────────────────┼────────────────┘\\n                         │\\n        ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐\\n        │                │                │\\n        ▼                ▼                ▼\\n   ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐\\n   │MySQL     │    │Redis     │    │Message   │\\n   │Cluster   │    │Cluster   │    │Queue     │\\n   └──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘\\n\\nVantagens:\\n- Escalabilidade máxima\\n- Isolamento de falhas\\n- Independência de deploy\\n\\nDesvantagens:\\n- Muito complexo\\n- Alto custo operacional\\n- Requer expertise DevOps\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ⚡ Otimizações de Performance\\n\\n### 1. Otimizações de CPU\\n\\n```typescript\\n// ❌ Ineficiente: Processar cada frame sequencialmente\\nfor (const frame of frames) {\\n  const detections = await detectPeople(frame);\\n  const faces = await extractFaces(frame, detections);\\n  const matches = await recognizeFaces(faces);\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Eficiente: Processar em paralelo\\nconst results = await Promise.all([\\n  detectPeople(frame),\\n  extractFaces(frame, detections),\\n  recognizeFaces(faces)\\n]);\\n\\n// ✅ Mais eficiente: Usar worker threads\\nconst workers = new WorkerPool(4);\\nconst results = await Promise.all(\\n  frames.map(frame => workers.process(frame))\\n);\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Otimizações de RAM\\n\\n```typescript\\n// ❌ Ineficiente: Manter todos os frames em memória\\nconst allFrames = [];\\nfor (const stream of streams) {\\n  allFrames.push(await stream.getFrame());\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Eficiente: Usar streaming e buffer circular\\nconst buffer = new CircularBuffer(10); // Apenas 10 frames\\nfor (const stream of streams) {\\n  buffer.push(await stream.getFrame());\\n  processFrame(buffer.latest());\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Mais eficiente: Usar compressão\\nconst compressed = compressFrame(frame); // Reduz 80% de memória\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Otimizações de Disco\\n\\n```typescript\\n// ❌ Ineficiente: Salvar todos os frames\\nfor (const frame of frames) {\\n  await fs.writeFile(`frame-${i}.jpg`, frame);\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Eficiente: Salvar apenas alertas\\nif (alert.severity === 'high') {\\n  await fs.writeFile(`alert-${alertId}.jpg`, frame);\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Mais eficiente: Usar compressão + rotação\\nconst compressed = compressImage(frame, 0.7);\\nawait appendToRollingFile(compressed); // Rotaciona a cada 1GB\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Otimizações de Rede\\n\\n```typescript\\n// ❌ Ineficiente: Enviar cada detecção individualmente\\nfor (const detection of detections) {\\n  await ws.send(JSON.stringify(detection));\\n}\\n\\n// ✅ Eficiente: Batch de detecções\\nconst batch = detections.slice(0, 100);\\nawait ws.send(JSON.stringify({type: 'batch', data: batch}));\\n\\n// ✅ Mais eficiente: Compressão + diferencial\\nconst delta = calculateDelta(lastFrame, currentFrame);\\nconst compressed = compress(delta);\\nawait ws.send(compressed);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 💰 Estimativas de Custo\\n\\n### Custo Total de Propriedade (TCO) - 3 Anos\\n\\n| Tamanho | Hardware | Software | Rede | Manutenção | Total |\\n|---------|----------|----------|------|------------|-------|\\n| 50 alunos | $1,500 | $2,000 | $1,000 | $3,000 | **$7,500** |\\n| 250 alunos | $5,000 | $5,000 | $3,000 | $9,000 | **$22,000** |\\n| 500 alunos | $30,000 | $10,000 | $6,000 | $24,000 | **$70,000** |\\n| 1000+ alunos | $150,000 | $20,000 | $15,000 | $60,000 | **$245,000** |\\n\\n### Custo por Aluno (TCO 3 anos)\\n\\n| Tamanho | Custo por Aluno |\\n|---------|----------------|\\n| 50 alunos | **$150/aluno** |\\n| 250 alunos | **$88/aluno** |\\n| 500 alunos | **$140/aluno** |\\n| 1000+ alunos | **$245/aluno** |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Matriz de Decisão\\n\\n```\\nTamanho da Escola | Arquitetura | Hardware | Custo | Complexidade\\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n50-100 alunos     | Single      | Desktop  | $$$  | ⭐\\n100-300 alunos    | Multi-Tier  | Servidor | $$$ | ⭐⭐⭐\\n300-500 alunos    | Multi-Tier+ | Servidor | $$$$ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐\\n500-1000 alunos   | Microserviços| Cluster | $$$$$ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\\n1000+ alunos      | Cloud       | Cloud    | $$$$$ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Escalabilidade\\n\\n- [ ] Definir número de alunos e câmeras\\n- [ ] Calcular taxa de processamento esperada\\n- [ ] Selecionar arquitetura apropriada\\n- [ ] Especificar hardware necessário\\n- [ ] Estimar orçamento de 3 anos\\n- [ ] Planejar crescimento futuro (2x em 5 anos?)\\n- [ ] Testar com carga esperada\\n- [ ] Documentar limites de sistema\\n- [ ] Estabelecer SLA (uptime, latência)\\n- [ ] Criar plano de manutenção\\n","lines":[1,2],"size":12066,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"1ldt2iw","at":1774580835589}},
